en:
] 1 of your Digimon may attack without suspending. Then, for every 2 of your Digimon and Tamers' colors, activate 1 effect below:
・This Digimon may battle 1 of your opponent's Digimon.
・By returning 5 cards from your opponent's trash to the bottom of the deck, [[K:Recovery +1]]
